## Data Enrichment Potential

| Category | Enrichment Opportunity |
|----------|------------------------|
| **Production time/machine-hours by product** | Conduct targeted time studies on top 5–8 product configurations to enable accurate labor allocation |
| **Changeover time and cost by product type** | Track changeover events for 30–60 days to understand true cost of complexity and optimize batching decisions |
| **Actual labor hours by product/project** | Implement simple time-tracking during Phase 1 pilot to move from assumed to actual labor consumption |
| **Utility consumption by machine/line** | Sub-meter key production lines or use rated power consumption to allocate utilities accurately across products |
| **Customer-level profitability data** | Extract from NetSuite CRM after ABC model stabilizes to enable customer segmentation beyond product-level analysis |
| **Competitor pricing benchmarks for commodity seal profile** | Conduct market pricing survey to validate floor prices for capacity-filling commodity volume |

